        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. In order to be entitled to holiday pay, an employee must work his/her regularly scheduled workday preceding and following the holiday except when an employee is absent because of illness or injury, and receives sick leave pay for the day[s] involved. The supervisor may require that the illness or injury is certified by a physician's note.",
